<!-- Problem Section --><section id="problem" class="py-20 bg-slate-100/70 dark:bg-slate-900/40 border-y border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800">    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">The Problem</h2>            <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">                Institutional Healthcare Triage is Broken, Fragmented & Reactive            </h3>            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">                Schools, universities, and enterprise campuses rely on paper-based health logs and delayed medical intervention, resulting in critical diagnostic bottlenecks.            </p>        </div>        <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">            <!-- Pain Point 1 -->            <div class="glass-panel p-8 rounded-3xl space-y-4 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">                    01                </div>                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Delayed Medical Intervention</h4>                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">                    Average emergency escalation in campus health centers takes <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">74 minutes</strong> due to paper records and disconnected triage protocols.                </p>                <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-semibold text-red-500">                    Impact: High risk of unmanaged acute illnesses                </div>            </div>            <!-- Pain Point 2 -->            <div class="glass-panel p-8 rounded-3xl space-y-4 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">                    02                </div>                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Data Silos & Zero Compliance</h4>                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">                    Over <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">82% of institutional health records</strong> are untracked across disparate spreadsheets, violating health data governance standards.                </p>                <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-500">                    Impact: Legal risk & non-compliance penalties                </div>            </div>            <!-- Pain Point 3 -->            <div class="glass-panel p-8 rounded-3xl space-y-4 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/10 text-brand-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">                    03                </div>                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Understaffed Medical Facilities</h4>                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">                    1 nurse per 2,500 students leads to overwhelming burnout and lack of preventative wellness monitoring across institutional communities.                </p>                <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-500">                    Impact: Decreased institutional productivity                </div>            </div>        </div>    </div></section>
